## Output instructions

{% if output_format == "phases_table" %}
Return a Markdown table with exactly these columns:
| phase | duration_weeks | cost_eur | confidence_pct |

List every major phase on its own row. After the table include a one-line summary with the grand total cost and total weeks.
{% elif output_format == "line_items" %}
Return a numbered list of line items. Each line item must include:
- Name of the work item
- Estimated hours
- Estimated cost in EUR (use a blended rate of 80 EUR/h)

End with a summary line: "Total: X hours / Y EUR".
{% elif output_format == "narrative" %}
Write the estimate as flowing prose in exactly 3 paragraphs:
1. Project overview and approach
2. Effort breakdown and key risks
3. Timeline, total cost, and recommended team composition
{% endif %}

{% if detail_level == "detailed" %}
